  <!-- EN: Burra bite -->
  <BurraBite.letterLabel>布拉咬人</BurraBite.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} got too close to the water and was bitten by an angry burra!\n\nThe fish escaped. -->
  <BurraBite.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 离水太近，被愤怒的布拉咬了一口！

鱼逃走了。</BurraBite.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Burra escape -->
  <BurraEscape.letterLabel>布拉逃生</BurraEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While reeling in a burra, {PAWN_nameDef} nearly bitten by the thrashing creature.\n\nThe fish escaped in the confusion. -->
  <BurraEscape.letterText>在捕捉布尔拉时，{PAWN_nameDef} 差点被这只惊恐的动物咬伤。

鱼儿在混乱中逃走了。</BurraEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Dactopus attack -->
  <DactopusAttack.letterLabel>双齿龙攻击</DactopusAttack.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} got too close to the water and was attacked by a leaping dactopus!\n\nThe cephalapod squirted it's ink and managed to escape. -->
  <DactopusAttack.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 离水太近，被一只跃起的触手鱼攻击！

头足类动物喷出墨水，成功逃脱。</DactopusAttack.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Daggert spine -->
  <DaggertSpine.letterLabel>达格特脊柱</DaggertSpine.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While handling a daggert, {PAWN_nameDef} was stung by one of the fish's toxic dorsal spines, causing {PAWN_objective} to drop the fish. -->
  <DaggertSpine.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef}在处理一条达格特鱼时，被该鱼的一根有毒背刺刺伤，导致{PAWN_objective}丢掉了鱼。</DaggertSpine.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Doshian jelly stinger -->
  <DoshianjellySting.letterLabel>多希安果冻刺</DoshianjellySting.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While handling a doshian jelly, {PAWN_nameDef} was stung by one of the invertebrates's toxic stingers, causing {PAWN_objective} to drop the creature. -->
  <DoshianjellySting.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef}在处理一个哆嗦果冻时，被无脊椎动物的一根毒刺蜇伤，导致{PAWN_objective}掉落该生物。</DoshianjellySting.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Faa escape -->
  <FaaEscape.letterLabel>Faa 逃生</FaaEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While reeling in a faa, {PAWN_nameDef} nearly bitten by the thrashing creature.\n\nThe fish escaped in the confusion. -->
  <FaaEscape.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef}在捕捉一只 faa 时，差点被这只惊恐的动物咬伤。

鱼儿在混乱中逃走了。</FaaEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Fleek eel escape -->
  <FleekEelEscape.letterLabel>鳗鱼逃生</FleekEelEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While attempting to wrangle a fleek eel, {PAWN_nameDef} stumbled and lost the slipper eel in the murky waters. -->
  <FleekEelEscape.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef}在试图驯服一条鳗鱼时，一个踉跄将舄卤鳗丢失在浑浊的水中。</FleekEelEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Laa attack -->
  <LaaBite.letterLabel>Laa 攻击</LaaBite.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} got too close to the water and was attacked by a the snapping jaws of a laa!\n\nThe fish managed to escape.. -->
  <LaaBite.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 离水太近，遭到了拉拉的攻击！

{PAWN_nameDef}侥幸逃脱。</LaaBite.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Laa escape -->
  <LaaEscape.letterLabel>Laa 逃生</LaaEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While attempting to reel in a laa, {PAWN_nameDef}'s line tangled, causing {PAWN_objective} to lose the catch. -->
  <LaaEscape.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef}在试图卷起一条laa时，鱼线缠绕在一起，导致{PAWN_objective}无法捕捉到鱼。</LaaEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Nyork nip -->
  <NyorkBite.letterLabel>聂耳</NyorkBite.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} got too close to the water and was attacked by a snapping nyork!\n\nThe clam managed to escape.. -->
  <NyorkBite.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 离水太近，遭到了鳄鱼的攻击！

{PAWN_nameDef}成功逃脱。</NyorkBite.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Thrashing paddy frog -->
  <PaddyFrogAttack.letterLabel>惊恐稻田蛙</PaddyFrogAttack.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} was suddenly hit by a paddy frog leaping out of the water. This caused {PAWN_objective} to lose {PAWN_possessive} catch. -->
  <PaddyFrogAttack.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef}突然被一只跃出水面的稻田蛙击中。这导致 {PAWN_objective} 失去了 {PAWN_possessive} 的渔获。</PaddyFrogAttack.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Ray attack -->
  <RayAttack.letterLabel>射线攻击</RayAttack.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} was attacked by a ray and was slashed by its serrated tail fin. The fish escaped. -->
  <RayAttack.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 被鳐鱼攻击，并被其锯齿状尾鳍划伤。鱼逃脱了。</RayAttack.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Ray escape -->
  <RayEscape.letterLabel>射线逃生</RayEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While attempting to reel in a ray, {PAWN_nameDef}'s line snapped, causing {PAWN_objective} to lose the catch. -->
  <RayEscape.letterText>在试图卷起一条射线时，{PAWN_nameDef}的鱼线断裂，导致{PAWN_objective}无法捕捉。</RayEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: See escape -->
  <SeeEscape.letterLabel>查看逃生</SeeEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While attempting to catch a see, {PAWN_nameDef} fumbled the thin slippery fish, allowing it to escape. -->
  <SeeEscape.letterText>{PAWN_nameDef}在试图捕捉一条鱼时，摸索到了细滑的鱼，让它逃脱了。</SeeEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Giant crustacean -->
  <SinkCrabEscape.letterLabel>巨型甲壳动物</SinkCrabEscape.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} saw the shadow of a massive crustacean beneath the water. The shadow startled {PAWN_nameDef}, causing {PAWN_objective} to lose {PAWN_possessive} catch. -->
  <SinkCrabEscape.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 看到水下有一个巨大甲壳类动物的影子。这个影子吓了 {PAWN_nameDef} 一跳，导致 {PAWN_objective} 失去了 {PAWN_possessive} 的渔获。</SinkCrabEscape.letterText>
  <!-- EN: Sink crab pinch -->
  <SinkCrabPinch.letterLabel>沉蟹夹</SinkCrabPinch.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: While fishing, {PAWN_nameDef} got too close to the water and was attacked by a the frenzied pincers of a sink crab!\n\nThe crab managed to escape.. -->
  <SinkCrabPinch.letterText>在钓鱼时，{PAWN_nameDef} 离水太近，被一只沉蟹疯狂的钳子攻击！

这只螃蟹设法逃脱了......</SinkCrabPinch.letterText>
